<title>INDIA: India clears $60 mln Gillette unit proposal.</title>
<headline>India clears $60 mln Gillette unit proposal.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Industry Ministry said on Thursday it approved a $60 million investment by Gillette International in a shaving blade joint venture.</p>
<p>The ministry said in a statement that the investment would give the Gillette unit a 49 percent stake in the venture.</p>
<p>It provided no other details.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
